[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Searching, Sorting, Filtering and Tagging

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SR-163
TITLE: Removing Tags from Audio Files
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall allow for the removal of tag assignments from audio files in 
a queue without deleting the tags themselves.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: UR-022

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SR-164
TITLE: Assigning Tags to Audio Files
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall allow for existing tags to be assigned to audio files in 
a queue.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: UR-022

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SR-165
TITLE: Searching Queue Tracks
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall allow for the searching of tracks in a queue using tags or 
supported track attributes.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: UR-023

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SR-166
TITLE: Empty Search Results
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall indicate when a queue search returns no matching tracks.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: UR-026

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SR-167
TITLE: Sorting Queue Tracks
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall allow the user to sort tracks in a queue using supported track 
attributes.
<<<
