UID: SR-168
TITLE: Filtering Queue Tracks
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall allow the user to filter tracks in a queue using supported track 
attributes.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: UR-025

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SR-169
TITLE: Empty Filter Results
STATEMENT: >>>
The system shall indicate when filtering a queue returns no matching tracks.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: UR-026

